[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://art/props-3d/characters/mannequin.glb" id="1_model"]

; The body EVERY player wears. Not a character -- the roster is the hunters,
; and a runner is anonymous, so this is one shared mannequin rather than a
; per-player model. Built by the same skin pipeline the hunters use, with the
; per-character extras off and no skin-tone normalisation: it is wood, and
; normalising would drag it toward flesh.
;
; Carries locomotion plus furniture poses by name -- idle, walk, chase,
; sprint, crouch, sit and lay.
